    "body": "Line: cross-state continuation · count 0/3 · headline M2 22/512 → 145/512.\n\nThe saved native model now completes **145/512** replies on the unchanged exposed development panel under its own emitted prefixes. This continues the retained #2152 cross-state field for a fixed256 additional updates, with exact fractional-master restoration and fresh Adam moments. Only the same115,200 Q4 coefficients learn; all upstream parameters and the native scoring mechanism remain frozen.\n\n**KEEP**, under the [preregistered >22/512 bar](https://github.com/UOR-Foundation/uor-r4/issues/2030#issuecomment-6096626604): **126 gains,3 losses,19 retained** versus saved22. Six of the original eight remain; two are lost. Entry222→454,EOS26→148,complete source-swap pairs5→25. Length8 is still2/128;367 replies fail. All gains/losses and seven prior-artifact comparisons are in the independent review. No retention veto was added or waived retrospectively.\n\nThe runner authenticates the prior seal/report/manifest/checkpoint, restores fractional weights, requires exact native re-export and all512 baseline outputs before updates, and keeps the zero-score cache separate to avoid double application. Four repeated fixed-order passes cover26,656 answer/EOS draws; local256/lineage320 is the sole endpoint. Checkpoints are recovery-only. An output-overlap guard protects the sealed resume parent before report creation.\n\n**If this came out the other way, would my next step differ? Yes.** A flat/regressed result would retain22 and close this continuation recipe. The gain retains145 and supports a preregistered next learning/qualification decision after delivery and cleanup. Closed ordinary24/96 and protected constructor/attribution/solver lines remain closed; zero preparation PRs.\n\nM2 remains incomplete: target256/512, followed by≥40% on a prospectively frozen fresh draw. This is exposed-development learning, with no fresh-draw/general-chat/geometric-advantage/energy qualification. Preserved22 and8 are separate fallback/evidence artifacts, never combined outputs.\n\nCanonical record: [docs/labs/m2-cross-resume-2026-10-10/README.md](docs/labs/m2-cross-resume-2026-10-10/README.md). Native field SHA256 `03781884edd6c2524c66e724c1fc65d9b9c62968d33b264d976282b49ce8094a`; report `e3a7e3ebd93c38253afb67f77ad3bb6b64a5e0ac50561f0204e1b83d22b8f4a5`. Independent reader verifies1,024 saved rows, initialization, schedule, early22/full endpoint and native coefficient changes. Actual model process744.528s; full cost including setup/build/review/delivery/cleanup closes after pod deletion.\n\nVerified iCloud package71,598,080bytes,MD5 `245a1879c52438e9a791fd74cce7b509`; full streamed readback and standard index PASS. Includes measured runtime/run/source bundle and retained accepted22+upstream package. Two launch-guard failures before model execution are retained; the single actual model attempt exited0 and sealed.\n\n- [x] Exact delivery-head checks and review posted before queueing.\n- [x] Producer e085fde9f source review and nine focused tests PASS; actual saved-model run and independent result review PASS.\n- [x] Canonical record/current-state with Next; curated README,STATUS,ROADMAP updated.\n- [x] Evidence preservation verified; no local archive staging.\n- [x] #2028/#2030 current headline updated after verified protected merge.\n- [x] Verify fresh main/whole-tree equality, delete delivery branches/worktree, hygiene and full cost closeout.\n\nReferences #2030. The continuous goal remains active after this result cycle.\n",
